      "narrative": null,
      "content": "1.\n2.\n2.1\n3.\nLinked Data applications, to offer a natural encoding of provenance for its targeted audience, and to\nallow for fast processing.\nThe following files are available:\nThe JSON Schema for PROV-JSONLD schema.json\nThe JSONLD Context for PROV-JSONLD context.jsonld\nOWL Ontology Extension to support PROV-JSONLD provext.ttl\nStatus of This Document\nThis section describes the status of this document at the time of its publication. A list of current W3C\npublications can be found in the W3C technical reports index at https://www.w3.org/TR/.\nA member submission by King's College London\nBy publis",
